      "optionIndex": 2,
      "isCorrect": false,
      "reason": "once-now-again：這是時間對比詞，不是水域主題鏈。"
    },
    {
      "optionIndex": 3,
      "isCorrect": false,
      "reason": "cleaned-has：兩個動詞不能共同指稱主題名詞。"
    }
